VERSION 0.1
DOMAIN software
INTENT study-t03
GOAL
  sum_to includes the upper bound.
CLAIM sum-basic REQUIRED
  ENSURE sum_to(3) == 6
CLAIM sum-one REQUIRED
  ENSURE sum_to(1) == 1
INVARIANT tests-green CRITICAL
  ENSURE all tests pass
VERIFY sum-basic
  USING mini.t.sum.basic
VERIFY sum-one
  USING mini.t.sum.one
VERIFY tests-green
  USING mini.tests
ACCEPT WHEN
  required_claims == VERIFIED
  AND critical_failures == 0
